WEBVTT

00:00:01.076 --> 00:00:04.838
Jennifer Lopez by Rod Smith.

00:00:04.898 --> 00:00:09.371
Penguin Readers, Level 1.

00:00:09.431 --> 00:00:12.822
Jennifer Lopez.

00:00:12.882 --> 00:00:15.274
She can dance.

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:17.296
She can sing.

00:00:17.356 --> 00:00:20.868
She is a smart businesswoman.

00:00:20.928 --> 00:00:29.640
She is beautiful, and she is Hollywood's number one Latina movie star.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:36.830
but the story of Jennifer Lopez starts in New York.

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:40.433
Young Jennifer.

00:00:40.492 --> 00:00:45.905
It is July 24, 1970.

00:00:45.965 --> 00:00:51.168
A hot summer day in the Bronx, New York.

00:00:51.228 --> 00:00:58.874
A lot of Puerto Rican people live here, and they are not all happy.

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:08.742
But it is a good day for David and Guadalupe Lopez and their daughters Linda and Leslie.

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:14.525
They are happy because they have a new little girl in the family.

00:01:14.585 --> 00:01:17.536
They call her Jennifer.

00:01:17.596 --> 00:01:22.298
Jennifer is beautiful and interesting.

00:01:22.358 --> 00:01:27.131
From four years old, she performs for the family.

00:01:27.191 --> 00:01:35.529
Sometimes she is a singer, Sometimes she is a dancer or a movie star.

00:01:35.589 --> 00:01:39.991
She loves the movie West Side Story.

00:01:40.051 --> 00:01:44.072
She watches it 100 times.

00:01:44.132 --> 00:01:49.755
In West Side Story, Rita Moreno plays Anita.

00:01:49.815 --> 00:01:57.182
For Jennifer, Rita is America's number one actress and dancer.

00:01:57.242 --> 00:02:02.298
I'd like to be her, Jennifer thinks.

00:02:02.358 --> 00:02:09.312
At five, Jennifer goes to a school of theater and dance.

00:02:09.372 --> 00:02:16.394
In a short time, she can sing, act, and dance very well.

00:02:16.454 --> 00:02:19.336
But is this important?

00:02:19.396 --> 00:02:22.507
David and Guadalupe ask.

00:02:22.567 --> 00:02:25.113
They have good jobs.

00:02:25.173 --> 00:02:28.939
They want to see Jennifer in a good job too.

00:02:28.999 --> 00:02:34.760
For this, school work is very important.

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:38.561
Jennifer the dancer.

00:02:38.621 --> 00:02:46.413
In 1975, Jennifer goes to the Holy Family Catholic School in New York.

00:02:46.473 --> 00:02:51.144
It is a good school and she is a good student.

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:56.598
But in 1983, The problems start.

00:02:56.658 --> 00:03:01.712
Now, schoolwork is not very important to Jennifer.

00:03:01.772 --> 00:03:05.093
She wants to be a performer.

00:03:05.153 --> 00:03:13.688
One day, in 1988, she says, I want to stop going to school.

00:03:13.748 --> 00:03:17.490
David and Guadalupe are angry.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:21.182
Jennifer is angry with them too.

00:03:21.242 --> 00:03:24.512
She walks out of the house.

00:03:24.572 --> 00:03:29.451
Jennifer lives in her dance school for a short time.

00:03:29.511 --> 00:03:34.942
Then she moves into an apartment in Manhattan with some friends.

00:03:35.002 --> 00:03:38.872
She dances in the school every day.

00:03:38.932 --> 00:03:41.093
She works well.

00:03:41.153 --> 00:03:45.084
Then she starts to look for a job.

00:03:45.144 --> 00:03:50.554
This is going to take a long time, Jennifer thinks.

00:03:50.614 --> 00:03:53.075
She is wrong.

00:03:53.135 --> 00:04:00.658
First, She gets a job in the theater show, Golden Musicals of Broadway.

00:04:00.718 --> 00:04:03.380
The show goes to Europe.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:11.556
Then, after five months, she gets a job in a new show, Synchronicity.

00:04:11.616 --> 00:04:15.109
This show goes to Japan.

00:04:15.169 --> 00:04:20.894
In 1991, Jennifer is back in the U.S.

00:04:20.953 --> 00:04:24.116
She is a very good dancer now.

00:04:24.176 --> 00:04:27.047
and she is beautiful too.

00:04:27.106 --> 00:04:34.052
A lot of famous singers want the young dancer for their short music movies.

00:04:34.112 --> 00:04:39.845
Jennifer dances behind the singer Janet Jackson.

00:04:39.904 --> 00:04:46.750
This helps her and she meets important people in the movie business.

00:04:46.809 --> 00:04:50.532
There are no problems with her family now.

00:04:50.592 --> 00:04:54.620
She has work and she is a success.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:59.829
She has a boyfriend too, David Cruz.

00:04:59.889 --> 00:05:08.846
Later that year, Jennifer moves to Los Angeles for the famous TV show, In Living Color.

00:05:08.905 --> 00:05:15.080
Jennifer is a dancer in the show, but she is not always happy in her job.

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:19.934
She wants to be an actress.

00:05:19.994 --> 00:05:23.960
Jennifer the actress.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:30.916
The head of the TV show, South Central, likes Jennifer's work.

00:05:30.976 --> 00:05:35.250
In 1993, he wants an actress for the show.

00:05:35.309 --> 00:05:38.922
He gives the job to Jennifer.

00:05:38.982 --> 00:05:45.328
After South Central, Jennifer works in three new TV shows.

00:05:45.388 --> 00:05:54.826
Second Chances, Malibu Road, and Nurses on the Line, The Crash of Flight 7.

00:05:54.886 --> 00:05:59.550
Jennifer is now a famous TV star.

00:05:59.609 --> 00:06:09.997
Then, in 1995, she is in her first Hollywood movie, Me Familia.

00:06:10.057 --> 00:06:14.120
Me Familia is a Latin movie.

00:06:14.179 --> 00:06:20.884
Her first English movies are Money Train and Jack.

00:06:20.944 --> 00:06:28.946
In Money Train, Jennifer is Grace Santiago, a New York police woman.

00:06:29.006 --> 00:06:33.920
Wesley Snipes and Woody Harrelson play two brothers.

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:36.412
They work for the police too.

00:06:36.472 --> 00:06:39.684
The two men love Grace.

00:06:39.744 --> 00:06:43.436
The movie is about their problems.

00:06:43.496 --> 00:06:46.898
Jack is a funny movie.

00:06:46.958 --> 00:06:50.700
Robin Williams plays a boy, Jack.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:56.686
People look at Jack and think, He's not a boy, he's a man.

00:06:56.746 --> 00:07:00.499
Jennifer plays Jack's teacher.

00:07:00.559 --> 00:07:06.413
In her movies, Jennifer is in love stories with famous men.

00:07:06.473 --> 00:07:13.958
Her boyfriend, David, is unhappy about this, and he goes back to New York.

00:07:14.018 --> 00:07:17.350
Jennifer is unhappy, too.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:20.958
But then she finds a new boyfriend.

00:07:21.018 --> 00:07:26.046
His name is O'Hani Noah and he is from Cuba.

00:07:26.106 --> 00:07:30.648
She marries him in 1997.

00:07:30.708 --> 00:07:36.002
In the same year, Jennifer is in four movies.

00:07:36.062 --> 00:07:45.997
The first movie is Blood and Wine with two very famous actors, Jack Nicholson and Michael Caine.

00:07:46.057 --> 00:07:49.985
The movie is about two bad men.

00:07:50.045 --> 00:07:54.182
Alex Gates and Victor Spansky.

00:07:54.242 --> 00:07:59.895
Jennifer is Gabriella, Alex's girlfriend.

00:07:59.955 --> 00:08:09.389
After blood and wine, Jennifer is in the movies Anaconda, You Turn and Selena.

00:08:09.449 --> 00:08:17.472
The movies are a success in the US, but Selena is a success in Latin countries too.

00:08:17.532 --> 00:08:26.274
In Selena, Jennifer plays Selena Quinta Nia, the famous Mexican singer.

00:08:26.334 --> 00:08:32.326
It is an unhappy story because the singer's life was very short.

00:08:32.386 --> 00:08:36.548
Selena's father gives money for the movie.

00:08:36.608 --> 00:08:40.590
The director is Gregory Nava.

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:45.682
Jennifer works on the movie in front of Selena's family.

00:08:45.742 --> 00:08:47.714
This is difficult.

00:08:47.774 --> 00:08:54.200
but the family likes Jennifer and the movie teaches people about their daughter.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:59.794
This makes Jennifer happy because she liked Selena.

00:08:59.853 --> 00:09:04.226
Selena is a big success in many countries.

00:09:04.286 --> 00:09:11.152
Suddenly, Jennifer Lopez is not only a famous name in the US.

00:09:11.212 --> 00:09:20.514
The year 1998 arrives, Jennifer is happy, but she can't take a vacation.

00:09:20.574 --> 00:09:27.138
She is in two movies that year, out of sight and ants.

00:09:27.198 --> 00:09:33.914
In out of sight, Jennifer is Karen Sisko, a police woman.

00:09:33.974 --> 00:09:37.656
George Clooney is Jack Foley.

00:09:37.716 --> 00:09:40.730
Foley takes money from a bank.

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:45.630
He gets away from the police and takes Karen with him.

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:49.339
The story is about their love.

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.752
Ants is a movie for children.

00:09:52.812 --> 00:09:58.286
We hear Jennifer, but we don't see her face.

00:09:58.346 --> 00:10:01.998
Men and movies.

00:10:02.058 --> 00:10:11.394
Jennifer's 1998 movies are a big success, but Ohane isn't happy.

00:10:11.454 --> 00:10:15.704
He and David have the same problem.

00:10:15.764 --> 00:10:21.136
They don't like to see Jennifer with men in love stories.

00:10:21.196 --> 00:10:23.998
Ohani moves away.

00:10:24.058 --> 00:10:28.440
Later, he and Jennifer divorce.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:33.935
But they meet often and they are good friends.

00:10:33.995 --> 00:10:38.318
In 1999, Jennifer has a new boyfriend.

00:10:38.378 --> 00:10:41.270
His name is Sean Coombs.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:44.798
He is a famous black singer.

00:10:44.858 --> 00:10:55.930
On December 27, 1999, Sean and Jennifer come out of a dance bar and get in their car.

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:59.092
The police stop them.

00:10:59.152 --> 00:11:03.114
They find a gun in the front of the car.

00:11:03.174 --> 00:11:08.666
The gun is not Sean's, but the police take him away.

00:11:08.726 --> 00:11:12.388
Jennifer is in the back of the car.

00:11:12.448 --> 00:11:15.222
It is not her problem.

00:11:15.282 --> 00:11:19.146
The story is in the newspapers.

00:11:19.206 --> 00:11:25.128
Early in 2000, Jennifer stops seeing Sean.

00:11:25.188 --> 00:11:29.819
In that year, she makes the movie The Cell.

00:11:29.879 --> 00:11:34.700
Jennifer plays Catherine Dean, a doctor.

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:40.302
Vincent D'Onofrio plays Carl, a bad man.

00:11:40.362 --> 00:11:42.882
He takes a young girl.

00:11:42.942 --> 00:11:45.594
But where is she?

00:11:45.654 --> 00:11:52.600
In 2001, Jennifer stars in The Wedding Planner.

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:57.032
This is a funny movie and a love story.

00:11:57.092 --> 00:12:01.366
Jennifer plays Maria Fiore.

00:12:01.426 --> 00:12:06.980
Maria falls in love with Steve Edison, a doctor.

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:11.422
The Wedding Planner is the number one movie of 2001.

00:12:11.482 --> 00:12:20.070
In the same year, Jennifer marries Chris Judd, a dancer.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:25.354
But they divorce in August 2002.

00:12:25.414 --> 00:12:32.709
Jennifer stars in two thrillers, angel eyes and enough.

00:12:32.768 --> 00:12:39.233
Then she is in Made in Manhattan, a love story.

00:12:39.293 --> 00:12:44.457
Jennifer starts going out with the actor Ben Affleck.

00:12:44.517 --> 00:12:50.512
In 2003, they star in the movie, Gee Lee.

00:12:50.572 --> 00:12:57.236
A lot of newspapers don't like the movie, but Gee Lee makes money.

00:12:57.296 --> 00:13:01.350
Are Ben and Jennifer going to marry?

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:03.010
People ask.

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:05.682
The answer is no.

00:13:05.743 --> 00:13:09.986
Jennifer's love story finishes in September.

00:13:10.046 --> 00:13:20.184
But in 2004, Ben and Jennifer act in Jersey Girl, the story of a father and his little girl.

00:13:20.244 --> 00:13:24.138
Jennifer is not the star of that movie.

00:13:24.198 --> 00:13:30.411
After Jersey Girl comes, shall we dance with Richard Gere?

00:13:30.471 --> 00:13:35.524
It is a love story about a dance teacher and her student.

00:13:35.584 --> 00:13:40.592
Jennifer sings for it with her friend, Mark Anthony.

00:13:40.652 --> 00:13:46.090
Some people are unhappy about Jennifer's movies at this time.

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:52.614
Jennifer doesn't act well and the stories aren't interesting, they say.

00:13:52.674 --> 00:13:57.546
But 2004 is a good year for Jennifer.

00:13:57.606 --> 00:14:00.988
She falls in love with Mark.

00:14:01.048 --> 00:14:06.002
Jennifer and Mark marry and they are very happy.

00:14:06.062 --> 00:14:12.873
After the movies, Monster in Law, an unfinished life and border town.

00:14:12.932 --> 00:14:18.206
Jennifer and Mark star in El Cantante.

00:14:18.266 --> 00:14:23.630
Mark plays the famous Puerto Rican singer Hector Lavo.

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:29.824
Lavo married Pucci and Jennifer plays her.

00:14:29.884 --> 00:14:33.526
Jennifer the singer.

00:14:33.586 --> 00:14:37.026
Music was always important to Jennifer.

00:14:37.086 --> 00:14:43.225
Today, the famous actress is a famous singer too.

00:14:43.285 --> 00:14:50.087
Jennifer's music success story starts in 1999.

00:14:50.147 --> 00:14:54.598
In that year, she makes On the Sixth.

00:14:54.658 --> 00:14:57.530
It is her first music CD.

00:14:57.590 --> 00:15:01.391
The name comes from the number of a train.

00:15:01.451 --> 00:15:05.063
Young Jennifer went On the Sixth.

00:15:05.123 --> 00:15:08.676
from a station near her home in New York.

00:15:08.736 --> 00:15:15.610
On the CD, she sings, no me llamas with Mark Anthony.

00:15:15.671 --> 00:15:20.704
She sings in English too, but the music is Latin.

00:15:20.764 --> 00:15:30.870
After only five weeks, if you had my love, from the same CD is number one in the US.

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:35.623
The success of Jennifer the Singer doesn't stop.

00:15:35.683 --> 00:15:43.738
In 2001, her CD, JLo, is again number one in the U.S.

00:15:43.798 --> 00:15:57.155
She is the first singer-actress with a CD and a movie, The Wedding Planner, at number one in the same week.

00:15:57.195 --> 00:16:02.138
In 2002, Jennifer makes two music CDs.

00:16:02.198 --> 00:16:09.653
The first CD of that year is J to the LO, the remixes.

00:16:09.713 --> 00:16:12.524
It gets to number one two.

00:16:12.584 --> 00:16:19.739
After that, this is me then gets to number two.

00:16:19.799 --> 00:16:26.954
Jennifer's CD Rebirth arrives in 2005.

00:16:27.014 --> 00:16:30.603
It gets to number two in the US.

00:16:30.664 --> 00:16:36.816
Then Jennifer makes her CD, como ama una muhair.

00:16:36.876 --> 00:16:39.056
It is in Spanish.

00:16:39.116 --> 00:16:46.462
A lot of Latin people love this CD, and it is number one in Mexico.

00:16:46.522 --> 00:16:55.066
In September 2007, Jennifer's CD, Brave, arrives.

00:16:55.126 --> 00:16:58.102
It doesn't have the same success.

00:16:58.162 --> 00:17:03.852
and only gets to number 12 in the US.

00:17:03.912 --> 00:17:12.148
Success in Business Jennifer Lopez is not only an actress.

00:17:12.208 --> 00:17:17.742
She is not only a dancer and she is not only a singer.

00:17:17.802 --> 00:17:22.576
She has success in the fashion business too.

00:17:22.637 --> 00:17:26.115
This starts in 2001.

00:17:26.175 --> 00:17:35.045
After the success of the wedding planner, Jennifer opens a closed business with Andy Hilfiger.

00:17:35.105 --> 00:17:40.497
Andy is the brother of fashion's famous Tommy Hilfiger.

00:17:40.557 --> 00:17:44.088
They call their business Sweetface.

00:17:44.148 --> 00:17:51.431
There aren't many clothes for big women, but this isn't a problem with Sweetface.

00:17:51.491 --> 00:17:55.172
Jennifer starts JLo, too.

00:17:55.232 --> 00:18:00.738
From JLo, Women can buy clothes and perfume too.

00:18:00.798 --> 00:18:09.650
In a very short time, Jennifer's clothes are famous and her perfume, glow, is number one.

00:18:09.711 --> 00:18:14.922
But some people are angry about Jennifer's business.

00:18:14.982 --> 00:18:19.563
Some of her clothes come from dead animals, they say.

00:18:19.623 --> 00:18:21.854
That's not right.

00:18:21.914 --> 00:18:26.226
Jennifer listens because she likes animals.

00:18:26.286 --> 00:18:30.329
Today, those people are happy.

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:34.011
Jennifer is in the food business too.

00:18:34.072 --> 00:18:41.166
In April 2002, she opens a place in Pasadena, California.

00:18:41.226 --> 00:18:44.168
Jennifer calls it Madres.

00:18:44.228 --> 00:18:48.020
Madre is mother in Spanish.

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:54.410
The food there is the Cuban food of her mother's family.

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:57.898
for the children.

00:18:57.958 --> 00:19:01.170
Children are important to Jennifer.

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:08.766
She does a lot of charity work for sick children and she helps families with very little money.

00:19:08.826 --> 00:19:12.238
These are important to Mark too.

00:19:12.298 --> 00:19:19.754
Today Jennifer Lopez and Mark Anthony are famous for their charity work.

00:19:19.814 --> 00:19:29.862
One night in May 2007, The two stars are in New York with the famous singer Paul Simon.

00:19:29.923 --> 00:19:34.496
They ask people for money for sick children.

00:19:34.556 --> 00:19:38.468
The night is a big success.

00:19:38.528 --> 00:19:42.830
People give a lot of money to the charity.

00:19:42.890 --> 00:19:48.374
And now Jennifer and Mark have children too.

00:19:48.434 --> 00:19:53.326
Jennifer's friends and family are very happy for them.

00:19:53.386 --> 00:19:57.597
For Jennifer, children are very important.

00:19:57.658 --> 00:20:00.800
This time is important too.

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:03.071
It is a quiet time.

00:20:03.131 --> 00:20:08.895
For now, work comes after family.

00:20:08.955 --> 00:20:15.399
Jennifer Lopez, the star with many faces.

00:20:15.459 --> 00:20:25.860
She's a dancer, a singer, an actress, a businesswoman, and she helps unhappy children and families.

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:30.564
Jennifer Lopez does all of these jobs very well.

00:20:30.624 --> 00:20:40.210
In the 1990s, Jennifer Lopez was the number one actress and dancer in the US.

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:47.154
Today, she is famous for many things in many countries.

00:20:47.214 --> 00:20:56.026
From Asia to America, people ask, Who is our number one Latina?

00:20:56.086 --> 00:20:59.954
The answer is always the same.

00:21:00.014 --> 00:21:03.080
Jennifer Lopez, of course.

